# Never commit firmware.
*.syx
*.bin
testout/

# The Digitakt port lives under DIGITAKT PORT/digi1_mods-main/ and commits its
# own assembled hook binaries (bin/*.bin); re-include them over the *.bin rule.
!DIGITAKT PORT/digi1_mods-main/bin/*.bin

# The port ships as that folder; the zip it was unpacked from is redundant.
DIGITAKT PORT/digi1_mods-main.zip
